","endBinding":null,"angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":72,"roundness":{"type":2},"type":"arrow","updated":1780417272353,"id":"arrow_7kon7vf3","x":1510,"seed":1138,"boundElements":[],"y":1320,"opacity":100,"height":350,"points":[[0,0],[0,-350]],"width":0,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","lastCommittedPoint":null},{"seed":1140,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"text_5mole17k","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":12,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1780417272353,"locked":false,"text":"Stripe updates users","version":73,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"b1c","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"baseline":12,"originalText":"Stripe updates users","height":15,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#475569","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":481708881,"textAlign":"center","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1440,"angle":0,"y":1117,"width":150},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#111827","link":null,"roughness":1,"groupIds":[],"index":"b1d","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":74,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1780417272353,"id":"rectangle_hnob25dc","x":40,"seed":1142,"boundElements":[],"y":1610,"opacity":100,"height":160,"width":1740,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":1763937855},{"seed":1144,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"text_4cam4arp","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1780418026885,"locked":false,"text":"Key architectural read\n\nLink Loom is deliberately split between a stateful browser-side actuator and a server-side AI\/data pipeline. \nSupabase is the system of record for proposed structure, progress, auth-linked ownership, billing gates, and backups. \nThe extension owns Chrome-native state and applies changes only after presenting a preview. \nThe queue abstraction lets the same worker code run inline locally, deterministically in tests, and through SQS\/Lambda in production. \nThe most important correctness mechanism is job_generation: it prevents old delayed\/retried jobs from corrupting the latest run.","version":81,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"b1e","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"baseline":51.25,"originalText":"Key architectural read\n\nLink Loom is deliberately split between a stateful browser-side actuator and a server-side AI\/data pipeline. \nSupabase is the system of record for proposed structure, progress, auth-linked ownership, billing gates, and backups. \nThe extension owns Chrome-native state and applies changes only after presenting a preview. \nThe queue abstraction lets the same worker code run inline locally, deterministically in tests, and through SQS\/Lambda in production. \nThe most important correctness mechanism is job_generation: it prevents old delayed\/retried jobs from corrupting the latest run.","height":131.25,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#0f172a","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":115314047,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":54.107291180930133,"angle":0,"y":1623.8902703831395,"width":979.7850341796875}],"type":"excalidraw"}